{
    "_comments": [
        "Custom syntax highlighting theme for www.gregorykapfhammer.com",
        "Light variant, designed for a white code block background.",
        "Palette derives from the site theme (united-light.scss / styles.css).",
        "Existing colors: deep orange #c34500, blue #0b5ed7, greys #343a40",
        "#6c757d, #dee2e6, #f1f3f5.",
        "New accents (3): teal #00695c, purple #6a1b9a, amber #a15c00.",
        "Schema: https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html#syntax-highlighting"
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "name": "GMK Deep Orange Light",
        "revision": 1
    },
    "text-styles": {
